# Natural language → component mapping

> Load this rule whenever you are translating a plain-language brief,
> a feature description, or a stakeholder requirement into a lo-fi interface.
> Parse the description phrase by phrase against the mapping below **before**
> writing any component code.

The authoritative full reference for **lo-fi** work is **[`docs/NL_COMPONENT_MAPPING_LO_FI.md`](docs/NL_COMPONENT_MAPPING_LO_FI.md)**.
For **high-fidelity (High Fidelity Design System)** briefs (message starts with **`/high-fidelity`**), use **[`docs/NL_COMPONENT_MAPPING_HI_FI.md`](docs/NL_COMPONENT_MAPPING_HI_FI.md)**, **[`docs/UI_PATTERNS.md`](docs/UI_PATTERNS.md)** and **[`docs/UI_PATTERNS_AGENT.md`](docs/UI_PATTERNS_AGENT.md)** (prop unions, UI rules, and component inventory when API docs are offline) — see `.cursor/skills/high-fidelity-prototype/SKILL.md`.
The tables below are the high-priority fast lookup for **lo-fi**.

---

## Step 0 — parse the description phrase by phrase

For every sentence or phrase in the brief:

1. Match it to a signal phrase in the **Signal grammar** table below.
2. Add the mapped component to a checklist.
3. Resolve any **disambiguation phrases** before proceeding.
4. Then open `docs/COMPOSITION_PATTERNS.md` → "Control selection rules" to verify you have chosen the right control variant.

---

## Signal grammar (fast lookup)

| Signal phrase | Components |
|---|---|
| "a list of X" / "a table of X" / "manage X" | `LOFITable` |
| "add / create a new X" | `LOFIButton` (primary) + `LOFIModal` (form) |
| "edit / update an existing X" | `LOFIButton` (compact) + `LOFIModal` (form) |
| "delete / remove X" | `LOFIButton` (dismiss, compact) + confirmation pattern |
| "opens in a modal" / "opens up" / "view details" | `LOFIModal` |
| "side panel" / "contextual detail" / "next to the row" | `LOFIPanel` |
| "basic information" / "name, type, status" / "fill in" | `LOFIFieldset` + `LOFIField` × N |
| free text attribute | `LOFIInput` (inside `LOFIField`) |
| on/off / enabled/disabled / yes/no attribute | `LOFISwitch` |
| attribute with 2–3 exclusive options | `LOFIRadio` |
| attribute with 4+ exclusive options | `LOFISelect` |
| "multiple options can be selected" / "choose all that apply" | `LOFICheckbox` per option |
| "save" / "confirm" / "submit" | `LOFIButton` (primary) |
| "cancel" / "discard" / "close" | `LOFIButton` (dismiss) |
| "X belongs to Y" / "nested Y inside X" | nested `LOFITable` inside `LOFIModal` or `LOFIPanel` |
| "steps" / "first… then…" / "wizard" | `LOFISteps` |
| "switch between views" / "grid or list" / "scenario A or B" | `LOFIToggle` |
| "status" / "type label" / "tag" / "category chip" | `LOFIBadge` |
| "saving…" / "loading…" / "processing" | `LOFILoader` |
| "after it saves" / "success message" | `LOFIToast` |
| "if there are no X yet" / "no results" / "empty list" | `LOFIEmptyState` |
| "filter by" / "search within" / "showing N results" | `LOFIInput` (search) + `LOFISelect`/`LOFIToggle` (filters) |
| "page 3 of 47" / "next page" / "paginate" | `LOFIPagination` |
| "a long description" / "notes field" / "multi-line text" | `LOFITextarea` |
| "error in form" / "validation failed" / "alert below field" | `LOFIInlineAlert` |
| "filter criteria" / "Search + Reset" / "Sport dropdown" | `kind: 'filter-query-row'` (`LOFIField` + controls — NOT `LOFIFilterBar`) |
| "hierarchy" / "tree nav" / "collapsible sidebar nav" | `LOFINavTree` / `kind: 'sidebar'` |
| "the main pane" / "production pane" / "UPL main view" | `LOFIMainWorkspace` / `kind: 'main-workspace'` or `'upl-shell'` |
| "breadcrumb" / "path trail" | `LOFIText` segments + `›` separators |
| "modal footer" / "Save and Cancel in the dialog" | `LOFIActionCluster` host `modal-footer` |

